// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Verbs
// spec: { lemma, perf, imp, root, form, flags: Set, masdars: [] }
//   Form I   is given as perfect:imperfect (قال:يقول) or just the perfect when it is a plain sound verb (كتب)
//   Forms II–X are given as a ROOT with @2 … @10 (درس @2 → درّس); weak and doubled roots are handled per form
//   @q / @q2 quadriliteral (ترجم) and its reflexive (تدحرج)
// flags: i (intransitive: no Form I passive participle)  np (no participles)  ni (no imperative)  ih (hamza dropped in imperative: كل خذ مر)
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
const PREFIXES = ['ي', 'ت', 'أ', 'ن'];
